  "project_description": "Submodule of Convivial Enricher. Provides a 'recombee_user_merge' EnricherDatasource plugin that, when a visitor is identified via the enricher token, merges their anonymous Recombee user (from the Recombee cookie) into the identified enricher user id using the Recombee PHP SDK's MergeUsers request, and writes the merged client id back as a long-lived cookie. Depends on the contrib Recombee module.",
